  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8747;</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sec</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sec</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sec</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sec</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sec</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></math></p><p>Differentiating&nbsp;both sides w.r.t <math><mi>&#8216;</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>&#8217;</mi></math>&nbsp;we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>tan</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>tan</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>sec</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>sec</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>&#8901;</mo><mi>sec</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>tan</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>sec</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><msup><mi>f</mi><mi>'</mi></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mi>'</mi></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>sec</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>tan</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>sec</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi></math><br />Hence, possible choice is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>.</mo></math></p>"
